 "title": "PrismAudio: Video-to-Audio Generation via Decomposed CoT",
 "summary": "A state-of-the-art framework for generating synchronized stereo sound effects from video using four-dimensional decomposed Chain-of-Thought reasoning. Developed by Alibaba's FunAudioLLM team, it leverages reinforcement learning to ensure high perceptual accuracy and temporal alignment.",
